# Frontend

- React + Vite + TypeScript, React Router, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Recharts, React Flow, MapLibre (`react-map-gl`).
- Routes must match `docs/PAGES.md` (`/`, `/login`, `/app`, `/app/suppliers/:supplier_id`, …).
- Do not compute official CO₂e in the browser. Display API/fixture numbers.
- Call snake_case fields as in the glossary. Detail page is not in the sidebar.
- Chat is a P2 overlay, not a nav item. Map/recs/scenarios may be stubbed with fixtures until P1 APIs exist.
